  "description": "Overview QC@IITI x IBM Qiskit Fall Fest '26 is organising a quantum hackathon organized by the Quantum Computing Club, IIT Indore in partnership with IBM Quantum. Introductory sessions and dedicated mentors will cover all the basics before the challenges begin for the offline challenge. Tracks & Dates Online Track: October 15–16, 2026 (Virtual) Offline Track: October 17, 2026 (IIT Indore Campus) Eligibility & Team Guidelines Team Size: 1–4 members (Solo hackers welcome; team matching available) Inter-College Teams: Allowed Inter-Specialization Teams: Allowed (Open to all streams & academic backgrounds Participant Communication Join our official Discord server for hackathon announcements, resources, team formation, mentor interaction, and important updates. Discord: https://discord.com/invite/5vNfBE5bz Hackathon Rules All code must be developed during the hackathon window (open-source libraries/datasets permitted). Final submission requires a public GitHub repository link and a brief demo. Prizes & Perks Prize Pool: ₹24,000+ total rewards Certificate of participation for all valid submissions Mentorship from IBM Quantum & QC@IITI experts",
