    "details": "<p><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Overview</strong></p>\n<p>QC@IITI x IBM Qiskit Fall Fest '26 is organising a quantum hackathon organized by the Quantum Computing Club, IIT Indore in partnership with IBM Quantum.</p>\n<p>Introductory sessions and dedicated mentors will cover all the basics before the challenges begin for the offline challenge.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tracks &amp; Dates</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>Online Track: October 15&ndash;16, 2026 (Virtual)</li>\n<li>Offline Track: October 17, 2026 (IIT Indore Campus)</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility &amp; Team Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>Team Size: 1&ndash;4 members (Solo hackers welcome; team matching available)</li>\n<li>Inter-College Teams: Allowed</li>\n<li>Inter-Specialization Teams: Allowed (Open to all streams &amp; academic backgrounds</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1019\"><strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1019\">Participant Communication</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1193\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1tjzfv1\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1158\">Join our <strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1059\">official Discord server</strong> for hackathon announcements, resources, team formation, mentor interaction, and important updates.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tian6t\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1193\"><strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1173\">Discord:</strong> https://discord.com/invite/5vNfBE5bz</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hackathon Rules</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<li>All code must be developed during the hackathon window (open-source libraries/datasets permitted).</li>\n<li>Final submission requires a public GitHub repository link and a brief demo.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Prizes &amp; Perks</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>Prize Pool: ₹24,000+ total rewards</li>\n<li>Certificate of participation for all valid submissions</li>\n<li>Mentorship from IBM Quantum &amp; QC@IITI experts</li>\n</ul>",
